{"meta":{"id":"object","category":"it/syntax/javascript/object","title":"객체 · Map · Set · JS","subtitle":"(JAVASCRIPT)","summary":"객체 리터럴, 구조 분해 · 스프레드, Map 과 객체의 차이, Set 중복 제거","tags":["javascript","f-object"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>JAVASCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">객체 · Map · Set · JS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 객체 리터럴, 구조 분해 · 스프레드, Map 과 객체의 차이, Set 중복 제거</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">객체</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const user = { id: 1, name: &quot;kim&quot; };\r\nuser.email = &quot;a@b.c&quot;;           // 속성 자유롭게 추가\r\ndelete user.email;\r\n\r\nconst { id, name } = user;      // 구조 분해\r\nconst copy = { ...user, name: &quot;lee&quot; };\r\nObject.keys(user);              // [&quot;id&quot;, &quot;name&quot;]\r\n\r\n// 프로퍼티 축약 — 변수 이름이 키와 같으면 한 번만\r\nlet mid = &quot;aa&quot;, address = &quot;bb&quot;;\r\nlet query = { mid, &quot;address&quot;: address };   // { mid: &quot;aa&quot;, address: &quot;bb&quot; }\r\nquery.mid;        // &quot;aa&quot;\r\nquery[&quot;address&quot;]; // &quot;bb&quot;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">속성 형태를 정하는 문법(interface, type)이 없다 — 형태 검사가 필요하면 TypeScript 사용</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Map · Set</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const map = new Map();\r\nmap.set(&quot;a&quot;, 1).set(2, &quot;숫자 키도 가능&quot;);\r\nmap.get(&quot;a&quot;);    // 1\r\n\r\nconst set = new Set([1, 2, 2, 3]);   // {1, 2, 3} 중복 제거\r\n[...set];</pre></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">객체 {}</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">Map</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">키 타입</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자열 · symbol</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">모든 값</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">순서</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">대체로 유지</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">추가 순서 보장</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">크기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Object.keys(o).length</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>map.size</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/javascript/object/object","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"javascript","title":"JAVASCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/javascript"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/javascript/object"}],"hasImage":false}